## 5. Uptime Monitoring

```yaml
# ✅ External uptime monitoring (run from outside your infrastructure)
# Use: UptimeRobot, Better Uptime, Checkly, Pingdom, or similar

# Monitor these endpoints:
# 1. Homepage — https://yourapp.com (check for 200 + keyword)
# 2. API health — https://yourapp.com/api/health/ready (check for "healthy")
# 3. Auth endpoint — https://yourapp.com/api/v1/auth/status (check for 200)

# Alert channels: Slack, PagerDuty, Email, SMS
# Check interval: 1 minute for critical, 5 minutes for non-critical
```

