## Monitoring Checklist

- [ ] APM / distributed tracing configured (OpenTelemetry or Sentry)
- [ ] Health check endpoints: `/health` (liveness), `/health/ready` (readiness)
- [ ] Error tracking with PII scrubbing (Sentry or equivalent)
- [ ] Uptime monitoring from external service (1-minute intervals)
- [ ] Custom business metrics tracked (signups, orders, revenue)
- [ ] Alerting with severity levels and escalation (P0-P3)
- [ ] Structured JSON logging with correlation IDs
- [ ] Dashboard for service overview (rate, errors, duration)
- [ ] Database monitoring (query latency, connection pool, slow queries)
- [ ] Log retention policy defined (30/90/365 days)
